== 10.8 Chapter 10 Practice Drill — 30 Questions

30 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 33 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [Which of the following is a hinge joint?],
  [Hip],
  [Knee],
  [Shoulder],
  [Neck]
)

#mcq(2, [Muscles are described as antagonistic because],
  [one contracts while the other relaxes],
  [they are the same size],
  [they are voluntary],
  [they are attached to bone]
)

#mcq(3, [The structure that joins a muscle to a bone is a],
  [ligament],
  [tendon],
  [cartilage],
  [joint capsule]
)

#mcq(4, [Herbaceous plants are supported mainly by],
  [sclerenchyma],
  [turgor pressure],
  [lignified xylem],
  [their roots]
)

#mcq(5, [Which of these is *not* a function of the skeleton?],
  [Blood cell formation],
  [Support],
  [Protection],
  [Production of bile]
)

#mcq(6, [The shoulder joint is an example of a],
  [ball-and-socket joint],
  [hinge joint],
  [fixed joint],
  [gliding joint]
)

